{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2. Crisp voxel style using vanilla Minecraft blocks only, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side of the SAME complete site at the SAME scale: LEFT straight-on front elevation, orthographic, viewed from the logging road; RIGHT a three-quarter view showing front, east sides and rear yard. Keep both complete sites and smoke fully in frame. Skilled human builder quality: real massing, projecting details, recessed and framed openings, roof verges, eaves and ridges, block-accurate stairs, slabs, fences, trapdoors, panes and hanging lanterns. No smooth geometry or invented blocks.\\nSite: northern lumber camp in a cut-over spruce clearing, 40 blocks wide and 34 deep, with a rutted logging road of brown dirt and gravel along the front. On the left a long low 1½-storey bunkhouse of dark bark-on horizontal spruce_log courses on a grey cobblestone plinth; walls 6 blocks high, roof ridge y=14. At corners logs cross and project beyond walls, alternating each course. Its steep grey slate-shingle gable roof runs along the road; dark eaves and pale stripped-spruce boards fill both gable triangles. A covered spruce plank porch runs along the front under a low shed roof on pale posts, simple spruce rail, two hanging lanterns flanking a spruce door. Shuttered square glass windows in log walls. Chunky mossy fieldstone chimney outside the east gable, past ridge, puffing cook smoke. Cordwood under west eave and open woodshed lean-to at back.\\nTo the right, across a dirt path, taller-looking open sawmill pole frame with pale stripped-spruce posts, knee braces and heavy top beam, but the same ridge height y=14. Its 45-degree grey slate gable faces the road, plank gable end, small loft door and spruce_wall_sign reading exactly \\\"SAWMILL\\\". A louvred ridge vent. Dark interior with saw carriage running front to back, represented with vanilla stonecutter, spruce slabs, trapdoors and dark beams. In front a low pyramid of bark-on logs on skids ready to roll in. Against mill east side a red brick boiler stack, dark deepslate band and stepped brick-slab cap, masonry to y=19, sending a tall white smoke column high above camp. Behind mill exactly three stacks of pale fresh-sawn birch boards with dark spacer strips along dirt lanes. Scattered spruce stumps, patchy grass/coarse dirt/podzol, chopping block by back path, tall dark spruce cone trees around lot edges.\\nUse these exact Minecraft block ids as the allowed palette, grouped by role:\\nbunkhouse_logs: spruce_log.\\nplinth_chimney: cobblestone, mossy_cobblestone, stone_bricks, cobblestone_slab, cobblestone_stairs.\\npale_timber: stripped_spruce_log, stripped_spruce_wood.\\nplanks: spruce_planks, spruce_slab, spruce_stairs, spruce_fence, spruce_fence_gate, spruce_door, spruce_trapdoor, spruce_wall_sign, spruce_pressure_plate.\\nglass: glass_pane.\\nroofs: cobbled_deepslate, cobbled_deepslate_stairs, cobbled_deepslate_slab, deepslate_tiles, deepslate_tile_stairs, deepslate_tile_slab, polished_deepslate, tuff_bricks, tuff_brick_stairs, tuff_brick_slab, stone_brick_stairs, stone_brick_slab, dark_oak_planks, dark_oak_stairs, dark_oak_slab.\\nbrick_stack: bricks, brick_slab, deepslate_bricks.\\nlumber: birch_planks, birch_slab.\\nground: grass_block, coarse_dirt, podzol, rooted_dirt, dirt_path, gravel, short_grass, fern.\\ntrees: spruce_log, spruce_leaves.\\nAllowed functional/decor blocks: barrel, chest, ladder, red_bed, white_wool, white_carpet, bookshelf, crafting_table, composter, anvil, lectern, campfire, smoker, furnace, blast_furnace, stonecutter, grindstone, cauldron, lantern, iron_chain, hay_block. These are available props, not a requirement to display every one. Use campfire smoke for chimney emissions, with voxel white_wool/white_carpet only if needed for static smoke. Keep details buildable. Label panels \\\"FRONT ELEVATION\\\" and \\\"THREE-QUARTER VIEW\\\"; no palette legend.\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"bunkhouse_logs\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"spruce_log\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plinth_chimney\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"cobblestone\", \"mossy_cobblestone\", \"stone_bricks\", \"cobblestone_slab\", \"cobblestone_stairs\", \"cobblestone_wall\", \"mossy_cobblestone_wall\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"pale_timber\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"stripped_spruce_log\", \"stripped_spruce_wood\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"planks\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"spruce_planks\", \"spruce_slab\", \"spruce_stairs\", \"spruce_fence\", \"spruce_fence_gate\", \"spruce_door\", \"spruce_trapdoor\", \"spruce_wall_sign\", \"spruce_pressure_plate\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"glass\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"glass_pane\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"roofs\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"cobbled_deepslate\", \"cobbled_deepslate_stairs\", \"cobbled_deepslate_slab\", \"deepslate_tiles\", \"deepslate_tile_stairs\", \"deepslate_tile_slab\", \"polished_deepslate\", \"tuff_bricks\", \"tuff_brick_stairs\", \"tuff_brick_slab\", \"stone_brick_stairs\", \"stone_brick_slab\", \"dark_oak_planks\", \"dark_oak_stairs\", \"dark_oak_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"brick_stack\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"bricks\", \"brick_slab\", \"deepslate_bricks\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"lumber\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"birch_planks\", \"birch_slab\", \"dark_oak_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"ground\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"grass_block\", \"coarse_dirt\", \"podzol\", \"rooted_dirt\", \"dirt_path\", \"gravel\", \"short_grass\", \"fern\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"trees\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"spruce_log\", \"spruce_leaves\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"saw_carriage\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"stonecutter\", \"rail\", \"iron_bars\", \"spruce_planks\", \"spruce_slab\", \"spruce_trapdoor\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"visible_props\",\n      \"blocks